/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project aims to perform semantic segmentation on images, assigning a pixel-level class label to each part of the image. The goal is to accurately classify each pixel into one of 8 semantic classes: Sky, Buildings, Poles and Cones, Roads, Pavements, Vegetation, Vehicles and Humans.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
